#X text 29 24 In order for [ELSE/euclid ] sequencer to advance \, we must provide step number to advance to. I found this design choice to be impractical for my use case \, so i decided to wrap an [ELSE/euclid ] alongisde a step counter in an abstraction. This way \, we can easily advance an [ELSE/euclid ] by banging it (which advances the step counter automatically);
